*  WAS ST R7,CPCREG6 -- RESET CP ASSIST ENABLE MASK, WITH R7   XA0019DK         
*  HOLDING X'02000000' OR ZERO. CPCREG6 IS THE I/O SUBCLASS    XA0019DK         
